{
  "info": {
    "name": "IAM Service - E-commerce Microservices",
    "_postman_id": "iam-ecommerce-smartovate-0001",
    "description": "Collection de test du service IAM (authentification).\n\nDeux dossiers :\n- **Acces direct (port 3001)** : appelle le service directement.\n- **Via Kong (port 8000)** : appelle le service a travers la passerelle API, ce qui verifie le routage /api/v1/*.\n\nLa requete Login sauvegarde automatiquement le jeton JWT dans la variable `jwt_token`, reutilisable pour les routes protegees des prochains sprints.\n\nVariables modifiables dans l'onglet Variables de la collection (email et mot de passe de test, ports).\n\nSPRINT 2 : ajout des routes protegees. La route /users/me exige un JWT (valide par Kong) ; /users est reservee au role ADMIN_METIER (autorisation par le service).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Acces direct (port 3001)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Inscription (register)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Inscription reussie (201 Created)\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"Le mot de passe n'est jamais renvoye\", function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.not.have.property('motDePasse');",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.not.have.property('motDePasseHache');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"L'utilisateur a un id et un role\", function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.id).to.be.a('string');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.role).to.eql('CLIENT');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nom\": \"Karim Benali\",\n  \"email\": \"{{test_email}}\",\n  \"motDePasse\": \"{{test_password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Connexion (login) - sauvegarde le JWT",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Connexion reussie (200 OK)\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"Un jeton JWT est retourne\", function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.accessToken).to.be.a('string');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.tokenType).to.eql('Bearer');",
                  "});",
                  "// Sauvegarde automatique du JWT pour les futures requetes protegees (Sprint 2)",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.accessToken) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('jwt_token', body.accessToken);",
                  "    console.log('JWT sauvegarde dans la variable jwt_token');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{test_email}}\",\n  \"motDePasse\": \"{{test_password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Connexion - mauvais mot de passe (401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Rejet attendu : mauvais mot de passe (401)\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{test_email}}\",\n  \"motDePasse\": \"mauvais_mot_de_passe\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Via Kong (port 8000)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "4. Inscription via Kong",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Inscription via Kong (201 ou 409 si deja cree)\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect([201, 409]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nom\": \"Karim Benali\",\n  \"email\": \"{{test_email}}\",\n  \"motDePasse\": \"{{test_password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gateway_url}}/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{gateway_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5. Connexion via Kong - verifie le routage",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Connexion via Kong reussie (200 OK)\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"Le routage Kong /api/v1/* fonctionne (JWT recu)\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().accessToken).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{test_email}}\",\n  \"motDePasse\": \"{{test_password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gateway_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{gateway_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Routes protegees (JWT requis, via Kong)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "6. Mon profil - GET /users/me (avec JWT)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Acces autorise avec un JWT valide (200)\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"Le profil contient l'email, sans le mot de passe\", function () {",
                  "    const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(b.email).to.be.a('string');",
                  "    pm.expect(b).to.not.have.property('motDePasseHache');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gateway_url}}/users/me",
              "host": [
                "{{gateway_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "users",
                "me"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "7. Sans JWT - GET /users/me (401 attendu, Kong bloque)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Kong bloque l'acces sans jeton (401)\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gateway_url}}/users/me",
              "host": [
                "{{gateway_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "users",
                "me"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "8. Liste des utilisateurs - GET /users (admin uniquement)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Avec un compte CLIENT, cette route doit renvoyer 403 (role insuffisant).",
                  "// Avec un compte ADMIN_METIER, elle renvoie 200 et la liste.",
                  "pm.test(\"Reponse 200 (admin) ou 403 (client) - jamais 401\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect([200, 403]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gateway_url}}/users",
              "host": [
                "{{gateway_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "users"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:3001/api/v1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "gateway_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000/api/v1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "test_email",
      "value": "karim@test.com",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "test_password",
      "value": "motdepasse123",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "jwt_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ]
}